<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal central bank denies it sold gold.</title>
<headline>Portugal central bank denies it sold gold.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Portuguese central bank denied that it had sold gold from its reserves.</p>
<p>&quot;The Bank of Portugal formally denies this,&quot; a spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>He had been asked to repond to persistent talk in the gold market that a central bank, possibly Portugal, had sold bullion out of its gold reserves.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
